meta {
  name: Login
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/admin/login
  body: formUrlEncoded
  auth: none
}

body:form-urlencoded {
  _username: {{admin_username}}
  _password: {{admin_password}}
  _csrf_token: {{login_csrf_token}}
}

docs {
  Session-based form login for the `admin` firewall -- distinct from the
  `api` firewall's stateless HTTP Basic used by every other request in this
  collection. Requires "Get Login Form" to have run first in the same run
  (populates {{login_csrf_token}}) -- CSRF was added to this form in the
  2026-08-24 security audit; a stale/missing token 403s. On success: 302 to
  /admin/, and Bruno's cookie jar picks up the PHPSESSID for subsequent
  /admin/* requests in "Utilisateurs" below.
}
